message: >-
  If you use this code or released evidence, cite this repository and the
  accompanying manuscript by its title. A paper DOI or arXiv identifier will be
  added when available.
type: software
title: "The Right Memory in the Wrong Context: Verifying Retrieval Admissibility in Long-Term Agent Memory"
