abstract: >-
  Evaluation code, frozen protocols, content-free evidence derivatives, and
  verification tools accompanying the retrieval-admissibility manuscript.
  The public package separates candidate support, eligibility decisions,
  prompt exposure, and answer disclosure, and documents which historical
  inputs remain outside the release.
keywords:
  - long-term agent memory
  - retrieval admissibility
  - reproducibility
